pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Historical #484 drive-only test, not a garage/paint qualification (#669).
# Traffic cars are no longer sold by hidden_cars. Run on a seed whose
# modded profile owns the car and has it selected (bought there with
# fh1-buy-car). The fh1-race inputs open the Gauntlet with the current car;
# A at the start menu starts the race (the Kenworth T440) or returns the
# car to free roam (the tour bus, game mode 17), and
# it drives for about two and a half minutes with throttle, alternating
# steering and occasional braking, captured every 1,800 frames. Check the
# capture events' vehicle_x/vehicle_z: the tour bus covered about 1 km
# (2042,931 to 2186,30) with no crash. The route checks stability and
# rendering, not the driving line.
# clock-hz 60
